    "Trade Marks Act 1995",
    "Part 7—Registration of trade marks",
    "Division 1—Initial registration",
    "70  Colours in registered trade marks"
  ],
  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "70",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s70",
  "text": "(1) A trade mark may be registered with limitations as to colour. (2) The limitations may be in respect of the whole, or a part, of the trade mark. (3) To the extent that a trade mark is registered without limitations as to colour, it is taken to be registered for all colours. Note: For limitations see section 6.",
